,7119,7120,7121]},"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116","text":"古今賢士大夫所以失名喪身傾家害國者，其由非一也，然要其大歸，總其常患，四者而已。急論議一也，爭名勢二也，重朋黨三也，務欲速四也。急論議則傷人，爭名勢則敗友，重朋黨則蔽主，務欲速則失德，此四者不除，未有能全也。當世君子能不然者，亦比有之，豈獨古人乎！然論其絶異，未若顧豫章、諸葛使君、歩丞相、嚴衞尉、張奮威之爲美也。《論語》言『夫子恂恂然善誘人』，又曰『成人之美，不成人之惡』，豫章有之矣。『望之儼然，即之也溫，聽其言也厲』，使君體之矣。『恭而安，威而不猛』，丞相履之矣。學不求祿，心無苟得，衞尉，奮威蹈之矣。此五君者，雖德實有差，輕重不同，至於趣捨大檢，不犯四者，懼一揆也。昔丁諝出於孤家，吾粲由於牧堅，豫章揚其善，以並陸、全之列，是以人無幽滯而風俗厚焉。使君、丞相、衞尉三君，昔以布衣俱相友善，諸論者因各敘其優劣。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116:m0132","start":132,"end":135,"surface":"顧豫章","kind":"person","person_id":"syc_ik6_bq5_**AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116:m0136","start":136,"end":140,"surface":"諸葛使君","kind":"person","person_id":"lpo_z63_vzb","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116:m0141","start":141,"end":144,"surface":"歩丞相","kind":"person","person_id":"snv_2iq_jes","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116:m0145","start":145,"end":148,"surface":"嚴衞尉","kind":"person","person_id":"szg_rhg_18d","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116:m0149","start":149,"end":152,"surface":"張奮威","kind":"person","person_id":"roi_rz4_ute_B","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116:m0288","start":288,"end":290,"surface":"丁諝","kind":"person","person_id":"esa_6ie_bng","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116:m0295","start":295,"end":297,"surface":"吾粲","kind":"person","pe